            <!-- CCPA -->

            <h2 id=3D"ccpa"><a href=3D"https://documentation.smartadserver.=
com/displaySDK/privacy.html#ccpa">CCPA (California)</a></h2>
            <p>
              The <em>California Consumer Privacy Act</em> (CCPA) is a priv=
acy law applying to all residents of California (United
              States). It has been voted in 2018 and became effective in Ja=
nuary 2020.
            </p>
            <p>
              You can find more information about this law and how to compl=
y with it
              <a href=3D"https://www.iab.com/guidelines/ccpa-framework/">in=
 the dedicated IAB website</a>.
            </p>
            <p>As for GDPR, the IAB CCPA framework defines a consent string=
 that will be obtained by a CMP and forwarded to
              all third parties by the SDK.</p>

